Cell["\<\
Lastly tanh series. For tanh it is very important to divide by proper value \
(max coefficient of MV is not enough: it yields nonconvergent series!)\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.819624467000914*^9, 3.819624515900344*^9}, {
  3.8199478880378447`*^9, 
  3.819947958556477*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"64a2b15e-5283-4055-802c-\
a807c7dcec15"],

