Cell["\<\
So, we see very good coincidence. Note, however that with even 20 terms only \
3 digits coincide. In order to have 6 coinciding digits we need to take \
nearly 40 series terms\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.819624467000914*^9, 3.819624515900344*^9}, {
  3.8199478880378447`*^9, 3.819947958556477*^9}, {3.819948499361617*^9, 
